OL,3,GNEWSAThe dump detectives on the trail
OL,4,Aof the fly-tippers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA discarded microwave, a mattress
OL,7,Fsodden by the rain and even a pile of
OL,8,Fused syringes. The reality of illegally
OL,9,Fdumped waste sits before me in a
OL,10,Fcolossal mound next to the side of a
OL,11,Fmotorway.
OL,13,FFor the team I'm with, this is a jigsaw
OL,14,Fwaiting to be pieced together and
OL,15,Fsolved as they try to identify the
OL,16,Fcriminal culprits.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
