OL,3,GNEWSAThe dump detectives on the trail
OL,4,Aof the fly-tippers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt does not take long for Anthony Horan
OL,7,Fand Ashley Hanley from North East
OL,8,FLincolnshire Council to find answers
OL,9,Fwithin the mountain of waste on the
OL,10,Fside of the Brocklesby Interchange near
OL,11,FGrimsby.
OL,13,FThey tell me it is a goldmine of clues.
